932490, 3932500, 3696980, 3696990, 3697010, 3697020, 3697030, 3697050, 3885660, 3968930, 3767550, 3767560, 3696510, 3767570, 3767580, 3696490, 3696500, 3697060, 4123270, 3308900], "detailed_description": "<h1>Monster Hunter Wilds Gold Edition</h1><p>*Content in this set can be purchased individually. Please be careful not to purchase the same item twice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/extras/c3fbeab71735d3a7f30cd1f19279c47c.avif?t=1787549555\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/extras_big/c3fbeab71735d3a7f30cd1f19279c47c.webp?t=1787549555 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Enjoy Monster Hunter Wilds bundled with the Monster Hunter Wilds Cosmetic DLC Collection, which includes additional DLC packs and other extra content!<br><br>Includes:<br>● Monster Hunter Wilds (main game)<br><br>● Monster Hunter Wilds Cosmetic DLC Collection<br>　・Monster Hunter Wilds Deluxe Pack<br>　・Monster Hunter Wilds Cosmetic DLC Pack 1/2/3/4<br>　・Blossomdance DLC Pack/Flamefete DLC Pack/Dreamspell DLC Pack/Lumenhymn DLC Pack<br>　・Monster Hunter Wilds Extras Cosmetic DLC Pack<br><br>【Premium Bonus】<br>・Hunter Layered Armor: Wyverian Ears<br>・Premium Bonus Hunter Profile Set<br>・BGM: Proof of a Hero (2025 Recording)<br><br>Please check the official Monster Hunter Wilds website for  details about the content.<br><br>*You may need to update to the latest version of the game to use this content.</p><br><h1>Monster Hunter Wilds Prologue Demo</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/extras/9a093c217f5aa33211039a81ba14bb9c.avif?t=1787549555\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/extras_big/9a093c217f5aa33211039a81ba14bb9c.webp?t=1787549555 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Monster Hunter Wilds Prologue Demo allows you to enjoy the game from the prologue up until you complete the ‘To the Forest’ mission.<br><br>*Please note that online features are not available for this demo.<br>*Please note that while you can earn Awards in the Prologue Demo, achievements related to Awards will not be unlocked.<br><br><strong>Transferring save data to the full version</strong><br>You can transfer save data from this demo to the full version of the game.<br>Notes:<br>- You do not need to complete the demo in order to transfer your save.<br>*Awards earned in the Prologue Demo can be carried over when transferring the save data to the full version of the game.<br>Also, while many achievements related to Awards can be unlocked by completing a quest once in the full version, please note that you may need to fulfil the conditions again to unlock the achievement.<br>- You will not be able to transfer save data from the demo if you already have save data for the full version.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The unbridled force of nature runs wild and relentless, with environments transforming drastically from one moment to the next.<br><br>This is a story of monsters and humans and their struggles to live in harmony in a world of duality.<br>Fulfill your duty as a Hunter by tracking and defeating powerful monsters and forging strong new weapons and armor from the materials you harvest from your hunt as you uncover the connection between the people of the Forbidden Lands and the locales they inhabit.<br>The ultimate hunting experience awaits you in Monster Hunter Wilds.<br><br>Story<br>A few years past, a young boy named Nata was rescued at the border of the Forbidden Lands, an unexplored region the guild has yet to survey.<br>After hearing the boy’s tale of his lone escape from a mysterious monster that attacked his village, the Guild organized an expedition into the Forbidden Lands to investigate.<br><br>A Living World<br>Environments within the Forbidden Lands can drastically change as the weather shifts constantly and suddenly. During the harsh Fallow and perilous Inclemency periods, ravenous monsters will venture out to hunt in packs, yet during the Plenty periods, wildlife is rich and abundant.<br><br>Monsters<br>The monsters who inhabit these environments have been forced to adapt to the dynamic changes that occur, using their unique characteristics to survive and thrive.<br><br>Hunting<br>As the world around them changes, so must the hunters and their tactics. Not only will hunters have a multitude of weapons and armor to choose from, but the art of the hunt itself has evolved as hunters learn to anticipate monsters’ behavior and familiarize themselves with their environment.<br><br>Characters<br>From hunting partners to fellow expedition members, you’ll encounter plenty of those who will support you on your journey.", "about_the_game": "The unbridled force of nature runs wild and relentless, with environments transforming drastically from one moment to the next.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a story of monsters and humans and their struggles to live in harmony in a world of duality.<br />\r\nFulfill your duty as a Hunter by tracking and defeating powerful monsters and forging strong new weapons and armor from the materials you harvest from your hunt as you uncover the connection between the people of the Forbidden Lands and the locales they inhabit.<br />\r\nThe ultimate hunting experience awaits you in Monster Hunter Wilds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStory<br />\r\nA few years past, a young boy named Nata was rescued at the border of the Forbidden Lands, an unexplored region the guild has yet to survey.<br />\r\nAfter hearing the boy’s tale of his lone escape from a mysterious monster that attacked his village, the Guild organized an expedition into the Forbidden Lands to investigate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA Living World<br />\r\nEnvironments within the Forbidden Lands can drastically change as the weather shifts constantly and suddenly. During the harsh Fallow and perilous Inclemency periods, ravenous monsters will venture out to hunt in packs, yet during the Plenty periods, wildlife is rich and abundant.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMonsters<br />\r\nThe monsters who inhabit these environments have been forced to adapt to the dynamic changes that occur, using their unique characteristics to survive and thrive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHunting<br />\r\nAs the world around them changes, so must the hunters and their tactics. Not only will hunters have a multitude of weapons and armor to choose from, but the art of the hunt itself has evolved as hunters learn to anticipate monsters’ behavior and familiarize themselves with their environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCharacters<br />\r\nFrom hunting partners to fellow expedition members, you’ll encounter plenty of those who will support you on your journey.", "short_description": "The unbridled force of nature runs wild and relentless, with environments transforming drastically from one moment to the next. This is a story of monsters and humans and their struggles to live in harmony in a world of duality.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/header.jpg?t=1787549555", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/970508d58e4f11f6f9ff3e2921b7eec558a50af8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787549555", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246340/970508d58e4f11f6f9ff3e2921b7eec558a50af8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17875495